WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:04.327
Prompt changes can alter behavior as much as ordinary code changes.

00:00:04.327 --> 00:00:11.522
Save prompt versions together with model identifiers, decoding settings, and evaluation results.

00:00:11.522 --> 00:00:19.122
That history makes regressions easier to reproduce and successful configurations easier to recover.

00:00:19.122 --> 00:00:25.872
If prompt version three performs worse than version two, versioning lets you reproduce the regression instead of

00:00:25.872 --> 00:00:27.609
guessing what changed.
